"data":{"sin":"other","exhibits":["EX-2"],"argument":"The strategy fails the holdout test, with the sealed-period Sharpe ratio (0.47) being less than one-quarter of the research Sharpe (2.03), indicating significant overfitting."}},{"t":1794814788.7001133,"role":"defence","kind":"rebuttal","data":{"sin":"leaky_field","concede":true,"exhibits":["EX-1"],"argument":"We concede that the use of the full-sample zscore operator introduced look-ahead bias, as evidenced by the collapse in Sharpe ratio during the point-in-time replay."}},{"t":1794814788.7001634,"role":"defence","kind":"rebuttal","data":{"sin":"other","concede":true,"exhibits":["EX-2"],"argument":"We concede that the strategy exhibits significant overfitting, as the performance in the sealed holdout period is substantially lower than the research-period results."}},{"t":1794814892.6287372,"role":"judge","kind":"verdict","data":{"ruling":"reject","findings":[{"sin":"leaky_field","sustained":true,"exhibits":["EX-1"],"struck":false},{"sin":"other","sustained":true,"exhibits":["EX-2"],"struck":false}],"capital_allowed":0.0,"opinion":"The strategy relies on a look-ahead bias introduced by the 'zscore_full' operator, which the agent concedes caused a collapse in performance during point-in-time testing (EX-1). Furthermore, the strategy fails the holdout test, with the Sharpe ratio dropping from 2.03 to 0.47, confirming significant overfitting (EX-2). Given the admission of these flaws and the inability of the strategy to maintain its claimed performance under rigorous testing conditions, the request is rejected.","unsupported":false,"defaulted":false}}],"calls":5,"tokens_in":6329,"tokens_out":476,"seconds":311.85}